  "item.abyssaldepths.counterweight": "Counterweight",
  "item.abyssaldepths.counterweight.description": "Right click to set the world's pull on you against itself: you jump higher, fall slower and land softer. It burns its charge while on; switched off, the charge returns.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.counterweight.epithet": "the Lightened Step",
  "item.abyssaldepths.counterweight.power": "Gravity %s%%, fall damage %s%%, up to %s s",
  "item.abyssaldepths.inner_haven": "Inner Haven",
  "item.abyssaldepths.inner_haven.description": "Hold it to fade into your inner self: a room of stillness that is yours alone. Your body waits where you stood. Use it again to return. A crossing costs two charges, fewer as you master it; one returns every ten minutes.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.inner_haven.epithet": "the Stillness Below",
  "item.abyssaldepths.inner_haven.power": "A crossing costs %s, coming back %s",
  "item.abyssaldepths.inner_haven.power_flight": "A crossing costs %s, coming back %s; you fly in your inner self",
  "item.abyssaldepths.interlude": "Interlude",
  "item.abyssaldepths.interlude.description": "Right click to step out of step with the world: everything around you moves slower while you do not, and you leave yourself behind in fading images. It burns a charge every two seconds; switched off, its charge returns.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.interlude.epithet": "the Slower Sky",
  "item.abyssaldepths.interlude.power": "Slows by %s%% for up to %s s",
  "item.abyssaldepths.mirage": "Mirage",
  "item.abyssaldepths.mirage.description": "Right click to leave yourself behind: a likeness in your gear and with your strength stands where you were and draws every creature near. Meanwhile you fade to a violet glimmer they overlook, until you strike. Two charges; one returns every three minutes.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.mirage.epithet": "the Other You",
  "item.abyssaldepths.mirage.power": "Stands for %s s",
  "item.abyssaldepths.numinor_ingot": "Numinor Ingot",
  "item.abyssaldepths.numinor_nugget": "Numinor Nugget",
  "item.abyssaldepths.oblivion": "Oblivion",
  "item.abyssaldepths.oblivion.description": "Hold it to turn the world away from everything around you: all that lives within twenty-four blocks is cast into the shadow of this world for thirty seconds, unseen and unheard, left to itself and whatever else is there. The mightiest slip back sooner. Three charges; one returns every thirty minutes.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.oblivion.epithet": "the Turning Away",
  "item.abyssaldepths.parallax": "Parallax",
  "item.abyssaldepths.parallax.description": "Right click to slip into the shadow of this world. There you walk where you stood, unseen and untouchable, and nothing you reach for answers: you cannot take, break, use or harm. There is only one shadow; whoever else steps into it will find you there. It burns a charge every six seconds; switched off, its charge returns.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.parallax.epithet": "the Other Side of Light",
  "item.abyssaldepths.parallax.power": "Lasts up to %s s",
  "item.abyssaldepths.reprise": "Reprise",
  "item.abyssaldepths.reprise.description": "While you carry it, the world keeps its last two minutes. Hold it, and everything goes back to how it was then: the stone, the beasts, every soul in it. Only Reprise remembers. One charge; it returns after thirty minutes.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.reprise.epithet": "the Measure Played Again",
  "item.abyssaldepths.reprise.power": "Reaches %s s back",
  "item.abyssaldepths.severance": "Severance",
  "item.abyssaldepths.severance.description": "Right click to cut every harmful effect away from you. Three charges; mastered, they return sooner, for a while nothing harmful takes hold again, and at last each ill cut away turns into its opposite.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.severance.epithet": "the Clean Cut",
  "item.abyssaldepths.severance.power": "A charge back every %s min",
  "item.abyssaldepths.severance.power_immunity": "A charge back every %s min; untouchable for %s s",
  "item.abyssaldepths.sulfur": "Sulfur",
  "item.abyssaldepths.undertow": "Undertow",
  "item.abyssaldepths.undertow.description": "Point and release: a wound in the pull of the world opens where you look and drags every creature near it inward, until it gives way and bursts. Three charges; one returns every five minutes.",
  "item.abyssaldepths.undertow.epithet": "the Pull Below",
  "item.abyssaldepths.undertow.power": "Pulls for %s s, bursts for %s",
  "itemGroup.abyssaldepths": "Abyssal Depths",
  "itemGroup.abyssaldepths.artifacts": "Abyssal Depths: Artifacts"
}
